   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HEIFER PROJECT INTERNATIONAL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Catalytic Impact for Dairy Sector Growth Project is implemented by heifer international with a target of 15,000 smallholder farmers in the dairy value chain in North Rift, Eastern and Western Kenya. The project aims at bridging the funding and technical gap that exists in SMEs operating within the dairy value chain by improving the competitiveness of the farmer owned dairy agribusinesses through market, business and financial development and technical capacity investment for impact and stimulating the growth of women and youth owned enterprises for improved household livelihoods</narrative>
  </description>
